    },
    {
      "text": "On: no title bar; spaCR opens filling the screen, and the menu bar moves the window while its marks minimise, maximise and close it. Off: the platform's own framed window. Remembered.",
      "source_sha256": "2c9f8b123a462ffc7de74f8690786d111a55658c4121cf14ab9386ee8d78d3be"
